From 46b9c058b760263f5ee498a7d63dc80be32968ef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zhongteng Gui <dragon-archer@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 01:34:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] sdl12_compat.pc.in: Avoid duplicate in Libs.private

When using `pkgconf --static --libs sdl`, pkgconf will first output
those in Libs, then those Libs.private, not only those in Libs.private.
So there's no need to repeat `-L{libdir} @SDL_LIBS@` in Libs.private.

This is also what sdl2-compat.pc.in already does.

Signed-off-by: Zhongteng Gui <dragon-archer@outlook.com>
---
 sdl12_compat.pc.in | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/sdl12_compat.pc.in b/sdl12_compat.pc.in
index 30c5028..2734faa 100644
--- a/sdl12_compat.pc.in
+++ b/sdl12_compat.pc.in
@@ -10,5 +10,5 @@ Description: An SDL-1.2 compatibility layer that uses SDL 2.0 behind the scenes.
 Version: @PROJECT_VERSION@
 Provides: sdl = @PROJECT_VERSION@
 Libs: -L${libdir} @SDL_RLD_FLAGS@ @SDL_LIBS@
-@ENABLE_STATIC_TRUE@Libs.private: -L${libdir} @SDL_LIBS@ @SDL_STATIC_LIBS@
+@ENABLE_STATIC_TRUE@Libs.private: @SDL_STATIC_LIBS@
 Cflags: -I${includedir}/SDL @SDL_CFLAGS@
-- 
2.56.1.windows.1

